{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/ef363c9a6dbac442e1ae17040cce3714.poster.avif?t=1764697801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/ef363c9a6dbac442e1ae17040cce3714.webm?t=1764697801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/ef363c9a6dbac442e1ae17040cce3714.mp4?t=1764697801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your troops in intense real-time battles where positioning, timing, and synergy determine victory. Form disciplined spear walls to counter cavalry, protect your archers from flanking maneuvers, and use the terrain to gain the upper hand. Swamps, forests, hills, and river crossings play a decisive role shaping the rhythm and flow of combat. From commanding small skirmishes to massive clashes with hundreds of units on screen, every encounter challenges your strategic instincts.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/c61da86145641ad38136fd399b2e5424.poster.avif?t=1764697801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/c61da86145641ad38136fd399b2e5424.webm?t=1764697801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/c61da86145641ad38136fd399b2e5424.mp4?t=1764697801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run through Tabletop Tavern\u2019s roguelike campaign is a new adventure, challenging you to adapt and evolve. Recruit new units, discover rare gear, and unlock  upgrades that permanently alter your strategy. With scaling difficulty, random encounters, and dozens of heroes and factions to unlock, no two campaigns play the same. Every playthrough offers fresh challenges and opportunities, demanding careful decisions to forge victory and master the battlefield.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/1e1f8844e5b290053cdd8f25af6af780.poster.avif?t=1764697801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/1e1f8844e5b290053cdd8f25af6af780.webm?t=1764697801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/1e1f8844e5b290053cdd8f25af6af780.mp4?t=1764697801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Command unique factions, each boasting distinct playstyles. Lead the elite infantry of the Vikings, the monstrous trolls and giants of the Orcs, agile and flashy Elves, stalwart Humans, resilient Dwarves, and so much more! Each faction comes with heroes whose abilities change how you craft your army to maximize your unit\u2019s efficacy in battle.\u00a0Building your army isn\u2019t just about numbers, it\u2019s about mastering your faction\u2019s identity and forging synergies that fit your preferred style of conquest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/1b6853123caac2bae510effc92c80cca.poster.avif?t=1764697801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/1b6853123caac2bae510effc92c80cca.webm?t=1764697801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/1b6853123caac2bae510effc92c80cca.mp4?t=1764697801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Recruit and lead a vibrant cast of mercenaries straight off the pages of a Tolkien novel. Viking berserkers, Elven archers, Human knights, Dwarven artillery and much more await your command. Battles unfold on a tabletop battlefield where every clash feels like a miniature wargame brought to life in real-time. Between skirmishes, you\u2019ll manage your roster, face difficult choices, and make strategic decisions that shape your campaign. With infinite build synergies, tough choices, and boundless replayability, Tabletop Tavern fuses the depth of RTS with the engrossing pull of roguelikes.    </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3337380?t=1764697801","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3337380?t=1764697801","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/1c270bad37065fc9dd887c0b4b0439f48f05833d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764697801","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/1c270bad37065fc9dd887c0b4b0439f48f05833d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764697801","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3410010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/5aaeae5ebe5d162ebebb88fc17d78f97.avif?t=1764697801\" width=1560 height=880 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline po