cast of mercenaries straight off the pages of a Tolkien novel. Viking berserkers, Elven archers, Human knights, Dwarven artillery and much more await your command. Battles unfold on a tabletop battlefield where every clash feels like a miniature wargame brought to life in real-time. Between skirmishes, you\u2019ll manage your roster, face difficult choices, and make strategic decisions that shape your campaign. With infinite build synergies, tough choices, and boundless replayability, Tabletop Tavern fuses the depth of RTS with the engrossing pull of roguelikes.    </p>","developers":["TJ"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/43aea20d1c9bed9b7dc4e80645e47ae797e33f4c/header.jpg?t=1764697801","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3337380/800481/2949dbb8b12df970046c3aec39f9b2f439cebff3/1750869878/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747784649","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3337380/800481/2949dbb8b12df970046c3aec39f9b2f439cebff3/1750869878/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747784649","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3337380/800481/2949dbb8b12df970046c3aec39f9b2f439cebff3/1750869878/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747784649","id":257082384,"name":"Steam Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257082384/fcd895761455a028cc6ff11770969c9e3f4678f9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747784649"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3337380/577938924/89fb4f94d67de030674f0908bd5bd68ad73ee400/1750869878/dash_a